<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .header-logo { font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-logo">NEW YORK INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <br><br>
    <h2>NYIT Medical History and Release Form</h2>
    <p>It is requested that the enclosed Health Assessment Form be completely and accurately filled out (by a non-parental health care provider) and submitted to your Program Director <span data-field="submission_deadline">{{ submission_deadline }}</span> arriving on campus. Immunization information is requested for the public health and safety of the campus and the participants. Without documentation of immunity, participants may be asked to leave campus in the event of an outbreak. New York State law requires meningococcal meningitis vaccination, or documentation of refusal of the vaccine, for all participants. Please review the enclosed information carefully, answer all questions on the forms, and obtain all required vaccinations.</p>
    <p>If your son, daughter, or ward is under the age of 18 while at NYIT, it is our policy to secure your consent for medical treatment. By signing the attached consent on the Health Assessment, you will be giving your consent to medical evaluation and treatment necessary to ensure the continued health of the participant. In the event of a major health problem, whenever possible, specific permission will be obtained from you. Therefore, parents of participants under 18 should be sure to include all possible telephone numbers (including cell phones) on the Health Assessment Form, and complete the authorization on the bottom of page one.</p>
    <p>International participants attending NYIT Summer Programs: please review the immunization requirements very carefully with your health care provider. The requirements may differ from the country in which you reside. The requirements are very specific and <span data-field="no_exceptions">{{ no_exceptions }}</span> can be made.</p>
    <p>Again, we are pleased that you will be here, and wish you a safe, happy, and healthy learning experience.</p>
    <br><br><br>
    <p style="font-size: small; text-align: center;">New York Institute of Technology Northern Blvd., P.O. Box 8000, Old Westbury, NY 11568-8000 nyit.edu 516-686-7659</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-logo">NEW YORK INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <br><br>
    <h3>REQUIRED FOR ALL PARTICIPANTS UNDER 18 YEARS OF AGE</h3>
    <p>This form must be returned to your program director <span data-field="return_deadline">{{ return_deadline }}</span> arrival at the college.</p>

    <h4>Parent/Guardian #1</h4>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="parent1.full_name">{{ parent1.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="parent1.address">{{ parent1.address }}</span></p>
    <p>Cell Phone: <span data-field="parent1.cell_phone">{{ parent1.cell_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Work Phone: <span data-field="parent1.work_phone">{{ parent1.work_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Home Phone: <span data-field="parent1.home_phone">{{ parent1.home_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="parent1.email">{{ parent1.email }}</span></p>

    <h4>Parent/Guardian #2</h4>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="parent2.full_name">{{ parent2.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="parent2.address">{{ parent2.address }}</span></p>
    <p>Cell Phone: <span data-field="parent2.cell_phone">{{ parent2.cell_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Work Phone: <span data-field="parent2.work_phone">{{ parent2.work_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Home Phone: <span data-field="parent2.home_phone">{{ parent2.home_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="parent2.email">{{ parent2.email }}</span></p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">PRIMARY PERSON TO CONTACT FOR CONSENT FOR TREATMENT OR IN CASE OF AN EMERGENCY</h3>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="primary_contact.full_name">{{ primary_contact.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Relationship to Participant: <span data-field="primary_contact.relationship">{{ primary_contact.relationship }}</span></p>
    <p>Check one: <span data-field="primary_contact.relationship_type_parent">{{ primary_contact.relationship_type_parent }}</span> <span data-field="primary_contact.relationship_type_legal_guardian">{{ primary_contact.relationship_type_legal_guardian }}</span> <span data-field="primary_contact.relationship_type_spouse">{{ primary_contact.relationship_type_spouse }}</span> <span data-field="primary_contact.relationship_type_other">{{ primary_contact.relationship_type_other }}</span></p>
    <p>Cell Phone: <span data-field="primary_contact.cell_phone">{{ primary_contact.cell_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Work Phone: <span data-field="primary_contact.work_phone">{{ primary_contact.work_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Home Phone: <span data-field="primary_contact.home_phone">{{ primary_contact.home_phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="primary_contact.email">{{ primary_contact.email }}</span></p>

    <p style="font-size: small; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">New York Institute of Technology Northern Blvd., P.O. Box 8000, Old Westbury, NY 11568-8000 nyit.edu 516-686-7659</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-logo">NEW YORK INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY</div>
    <br><br>
    <h3>NYIT PROGRAMS HEALTH FORM</h3>
    <p>(TO BE COMPLETED BY MEDICAL PROVIDER)</p>
    <h4>REQUIRED MEDICAL HISTORY</h4>
    <br><br>
    <p>Participant Name: <span data-field="participant.full_name">{{ participant.full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Date of Birth: <span data-field="participant.date_of_birth">{{ participant.date_of_birth }}</span></p>
    <br><br>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p>Allergies</p>
        <div style="height: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;" data-field="allergies">{{ allergies }}</div>
    </div>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p>Medications</p>
        <div style="height: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;" data-field="medications">{{ medications }}</div>
    </div>

    <p>Please list all current medical problems and related treatments</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <p>Special Accommodations Needed? YES NO Please explain.</p>
        <div style="height: 100px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;" data-field="medications_2">{{ medications_2 }}</div>
    </div>

    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="height: 150px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
    </div>

    <p>Provider Name: <span data-field="provider.name">{{ provider.name }}</span></p>
    <p>Provider Signature / Stamp: <div style="height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;" data-field="provider_name">{{ provider_name }}</div></p>
    <p>Date: <span data-field="provider.date">{{ provider.date }}</span></p>
    <p>Address: <span data-field="provider.address">{{ provider.address }}</span></p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="provider.phone">{{ provider.phone }}</span></p>

    <p style="font-size: small; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">New York Institute of Technology Northern Blvd., P.O. Box 8000, Old Westbury, NY 11568-8000 nyit.edu 516-686-7659</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>